1577
01:42:56,483 --> 01:42:57,683
At least nobody's died

1578
01:42:57,683 --> 01:43:01,183
So close to giving up, giving out, giving in

1579
01:43:01,183 --> 01:43:05,183
Could I still live again, live again, live again?

1580
01:43:05,183 --> 01:43:09,883
But what's the point in fighting when nothing lasts at all?

1581
01:43:10,683 --> 01:43:15,083
On your last day, standing here alone with you

1582
01:43:15,083 --> 01:43:20,683
I found my vision was way off, way off, yeah

1583
01:43:20,683 --> 01:43:24,683
Now I can't wake up, wake up, yeah

1584
01:43:24,683 --> 01:43:29,483
Don't tell me it's over, it must be

1585
01:43:29,483 --> 01:43:33,683
Is it gonna be just me left behind?

1586
01:43:33,683 --> 01:43:35,683
Me and my mind

1587
01:43:35,683 --> 01:43:38,983
Every now and then, reality creeps in

1588
01:43:38,983 --> 01:43:41,983
Every now and then, I glance over the deep end

1589
01:43:41,983 --> 01:43:46,083
You'll live on, still, so when I'm not around

1590
01:43:46,083 --> 01:43:49,683
Remember me, remember what we found

1591
01:43:49,683 --> 01:43:53,983
On our last day, standing here alone

1592
01:43:53,983 --> 01:43:55,583
'Cause nothing lasts forever

1593
01:43:55,583 --> 01:43:59,083
Wake up, wake up, yeah

1594
01:43:59,083 --> 01:44:02,083
No, I can't wake up, wake up, yeah

1595
01:44:02,083 --> 01:44:06,483
No, it's not over, it can't be

1596
01:44:06,483 --> 01:44:09,283
Is it gonna be just me left behind?

1597
01:44:09,283 --> 01:44:13,483
Is this goodbye?

1598
01:44:13,483 --> 01:44:17,083
On my last day, doesn't matter where or when

1599
01:44:17,083 --> 01:44:21,683
I swear I'll find us a way out, way out, yeah

1600
01:44:21,683 --> 01:44:25,183
So let things play out, play out, yeah

1601
01:44:25,183 --> 01:44:28,733
'Cause I know some dreams just can't come true

1602
01:44:28,733 --> 01:44:32,683
But I wanna see you again sometime

1603
01:44:32,683 --> 01:44:37,283
That song in my heart, it kept me alive

1604
01:45:08,302 --> 01:45:09,862
Hey there, Deadbeats.

1605
01:45:11,722 --> 01:45:12,822
Hey there.

1606
01:45:13,492 --> 01:45:14,302
It's me.

1607
01:45:14,872 --> 01:45:16,482
It's okay to be sad.

1608
01:45:17,622 --> 01:45:24,652
It's okay to miss the people who changed our lives, if they aren't here anymore.

1609
01:45:26,152 --> 01:45:27,612
I think...

1610
01:45:28,422 --> 01:45:29,502
It's okay.

1611
01:45:30,252 --> 01:45:32,622
But as long as we have memories, right?

1612
01:45:33,522 --> 01:45:40,282
Um, then I think, maybe, just maybe, it'll be okay.

1613
01:45:40,582 --> 01:45:44,112
Even if we never truly move on.

1614
01:45:45,052 --> 01:45:48,532
I'm happy that we have memories, right?

1615
01:45:49,452 --> 01:45:58,312
And to never, never forget all the stuff that we did together, 'cause we did some really amazing stuff, don't you guys think?

1616
01:45:58,842 --> 01:45:59,642
I think we did.

1617
01:46:04,112 --> 01:46:07,662
And I don't want to forget any of that 'cause, like I said, I don't really have any plans to get going anytime soon.

1618
01:46:08,092 --> 01:46:15,892
But I guess the way that I feel about it is, I'd like to keep remembering...

1619
01:46:16,912 --> 01:46:24,762
all those people and things that we did fondly, regardless of anything.

1620
01:46:25,362 --> 01:46:33,332
Even through the years, and though they may pass by, and even when the wounds aren't fresh anymore,

1621
01:46:34,272 --> 01:46:36,152
I still... I still want to remember.

1622
01:46:36,452 --> 01:46:47,952
I know it's hard to... It's hard to move forward sometimes when the things that we love and care about are still behind us, right? Stuck in the past, but...

1623
01:46:48,522 --> 01:46:55,392
I'm going to be here to make you smile no matter what, right now.

1624
01:46:55,692 --> 01:46:58,902
'Cause there's still stuff I want to do, you know?

1625
01:46:59,062 --> 01:47:06,032
And yeah, that's a good point, the good memories, they should make you sad because...

1626
01:47:06,822 --> 01:47:08,862
Because that means they were truly good.

1627
01:47:09,572 --> 01:47:11,122
We did a lot of really good stuff.

1628
01:47:11,452 --> 01:47:12,282
You guys think?

1629
01:47:12,842 --> 01:47:15,462
Well, I'm glad that I sang that here with Ina.

1630
01:47:16,042 --> 01:47:17,052
I'm really glad.

1631
01:47:17,622 --> 01:47:20,602
But there's still some people that I haven't sung with, so...

1632
01:47:21,192 --> 01:47:23,852
Let's head to the final area, shall we?

1633
01:47:24,622 --> 01:47:27,222
What if I just... bam, teleported myself there...

1634
01:47:27,662 --> 01:47:29,352
and use my crazy powers of...

1635
01:47:29,572 --> 01:47:31,132
Oh, my waist is broken.

1636
