That's okay.

1637
01:47:33,052 --> 01:47:34,122
No, it's fine.

1638
01:47:34,342 --> 01:47:36,032
All good, all good.

1639
01:47:36,192 --> 01:47:39,052
I probably just need to T-pose real quick.

1640
