Hey, watch this, watch my sick T-pose.

1641
01:47:42,822 --> 01:47:44,952
Hang on, I'm already good at this.

1642
01:47:45,232 --> 01:47:47,912
I've become pro at VR Chat in just this short time.

1643
01:47:48,312 --> 01:47:49,742
There we go.

1644
01:47:50,072 --> 01:47:50,702
Fixed.

1645
