1734
01:53:22,777 --> 01:53:29,977
Get ready for lots more shows together, Deadbeats, and thanks for the unforgettable five years! Love!

1735
01:53:32,313 --> 01:53:33,653
Hello.

1736
01:53:33,753 --> 01:53:39,473
Thank you so much, everybody. I hope you guys enjoy the goods.

1737
01:53:37,013 --> 01:53:41,953
