1740
01:53:50,923 --> 01:53:54,963
If you're quick, you got to be quick, cuz they do have a limited number.

1741
01:53:54,963 --> 01:54:04,743
Um, but yeah, please enjoy, and thank you always for supporting me so much. There will be a members-only encore after this featuring a few more songs and just getting to chat with my members, which I'm excited about.

1742
01:54:04,743 --> 01:54:09,473
Um, so please look forward to that.

1743
01:54:05,463 --> 01:54:12,993
And there's a new song! I should look a little happier about that.

1744
01:54:12,993 --> 01:54:22,873
There's a new song coming out, and I haven't really given any hints about what kind of song it is. People are like, oh, it's going to be so emotional. This looks like an emotional song, but knowing what the song is makes me laugh really hard.

1745
01:54:22,873 --> 01:54:28,833
Cuz it's actually a lot simpler than you think.

1746
01:54:23,873 --> 01:54:39,503
Something about my early music is that, man, I was so honest, you know? And so I wanted to write a song that not just me myself, I as a person could relate to, but anyone, anyone who has an oshi could relate to.

1747
01:54:39,503 --> 01:54:48,693
And so, I hope that you will enjoy it, because it feels like an older Mori song while also being a newer Mori song.

1748
01:54:48,693 --> 01:54:56,133
It's hard to explain, but I guess you'll just have to watch it and see. MV is really cute, so we'll watch that premiere together, too.

1749
